# --- picomatch-port (branch chirag) ---
# Rust build artifacts
target/
# benchmark/bench raw outputs except committed reports
artifacts/tmp/
# fuzzer artifacts (crashes are triaged into tests/fixtures, not committed raw)
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
# proptest regressions are COMMITTED intentionally (do not ignore)
# scratch large dumps (scratch/ itself stays, but bulky generated data is ignored)
scratch/out/

